That's very low HP for Gehennom.  If you have any potions of extra
healing, I suggest that you bless and quaff them while at full health
to boost your max HP (or even alchemise them to make potions of full
healing).  What's your Constitution?  In future, try to max it out as
soon as possible so that you get the best HP gain from levelling up.
You can gain Con by keeping from being hungry for a long time or by
dancing with foocubi.

Maybe you've never had trouble with Orcus before because you always
killed him while he was still emptying his wand of death into you?
